'''Recall Potion''' is an {{Epic}} item.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Recall Potion''' can be obtained from the treasure bundle that is spawned after placing all [[Gemstone Crystals]] in the [[Crystal Nucleus]]. It has a {{Chance|0.08244159%|1|1212.98}}  chance to be rolled for each drop in the treasure bundle.

== Usage ==
Right clicking will open an interface. The player can save a set of coordinates, or warp to a set of coordinates that has been saved. The item will be consumed upon warping to a location.

