{{/UI}}

== Trivia ==
*The item's name and texture seems to be inspired by [[terraria:Recall Potion|an item of the same name]] from [[terraria:Terraria|Terraria]]. This is further supported by the item lore, "''A mystical and glowing elixir imbued with special abilities from another dimension''."
**The ability on the other hand seems to be inspired by another Terraria potion, the [[terraria:Potion of Return|Potion of Return]].

